# Build context for the declaragent agent image. node_modules is excluded so
# `bun install` resolves correct-arch deps inside the image; pre-built `dist/`
# (arch-independent JS emitted by tsc) IS included so the image ships the
# already-verified build rather than re-running the monorepo tsc build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
docs-site
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
coverage
*.log
.DS_Store
/tmp
